'''The Guardian''' is a [[Boss]] that can appear at the end of [[Act 1]] or the [[Act 3]] event {{E|Mind Bloom}}.

== Pattern ==
{{Intents|The Guardian}}
Repeats the following pattern:
#{{Int|The Guardian|Charging Up}}
#{{Int|The Guardian|Fierce Bash}}
#{{Int|The Guardian|Vent Steam}}
#{{Int|The Guardian|Whirlwind}}

When Guardian triggers {{KW|Mode Shift}} the current [[Intent]] is replaced with {{Int|The Guardian|Defensive Mode}}.

After {{Int|The Guardian|Defensive Mode}}, Guardian uses {{Int|The Guardian|Roll Attack}}, followed by {{Int|The Guardian|Twin Slam}} and {{Int|The Guardian|Whirlwind}}. Then the initial pattern restarts.

<!-- == Hints == 
* Interrupt Fierce Bash by triggering mode shift
* Play block cards while in Defensive Mode
* Permanently sources of minus strength good
-->
